namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamPassBlueprintLibrary {
    at    Source/DreamShaderPass/Public/DreamPassBlueprintLibrary.h#DreamPassBlueprintLibrary
    src   "Blueprint access to UDreamPassSubsystem: activating pipelines, setting their parameters, filling mesh pass lists."
    text  "从蓝图访问 UDreamPassSubsystem：激活管线、设置其参数、填充网格 Pass 列表。"
    state machine
}

DreamPassBlueprintLibrary:AddPipeline {
    at    Source/DreamShaderPass/Public/DreamPassBlueprintLibrary.h#DreamPassBlueprintLibrary:AddPipeline
    src   "Runs Pipeline in the world's views -- every view, or PlayerIndex's only -- until RemovePipeline."
    text  "在世界的视图里运行 Pipeline——所有视图，或仅 PlayerIndex 的视图——直到 RemovePipeline。"
    state machine
}

DreamPassBlueprintLibrary:AddToList {
    at    Source/DreamShaderPass/Public/DreamPassBlueprintLibrary.h#DreamPassBlueprintLibrary:AddToList
    src   "Puts a primitive in a named list, which a mesh pass selects with `Filter = List(Name)`."
    text  "把图元放进一个具名列表，网格 Pass 可用 `Filter = List(Name)` 选择它。"
    state machine
}

DreamPassBlueprintLibrary:GetExportTarget {
    at    Source/DreamShaderPass/Public/DreamPassBlueprintLibrary.h#DreamPassBlueprintLibrary:GetExportTarget
    src   "The render target an exported buffer is copied into, for UMG, Niagara or a material parameter."
